      "name": "Acción principal",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Variante implementada en el catálogo; conserva altura mínima y foco visible.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">Aportar un lugar</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid #a8a29e;border-radius:8px;font-size:.925rem;font-weight:650;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .15s,border-color .15s;font-family:var(--font-sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif);background:var(--color-tropa, #C1272D);border-color:var(--color-tropa, #C1272D);color:#fff;}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:var(--color-tropa-dark, #A11F25);border-color:var(--color-tropa-dark, #A11F25);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-tropa, #C1272D);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Acción secundaria",
